        "166442457738b23caf-0": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why is the 27° angle so important?",
            "content": "<p>The precise 27° angle was scientifically designed to allow optimal positioning, release tension, and promote deeper connection between partners. This angle ensures natural alignment and stable support during every use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-1": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How is this pillow different from a normal one?",
            "content": "<p>It’s a versatile ergonomic wellness product. It improves posture, relieves back pressure, maintains the perfect angle, and blends seamlessly into your home, without looking like an “intimate product.”</p>"
          }
        },
        "166442457738b23caf-2": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is it comfortable for back or hip pain?",
            "content": "<p>Yes! The high-density memory foam combined with its thoughtful angle reduces pressure points, making every position more comfortable and accessible, even for those with physical discomfort.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_JdpFKP": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does the pillow stay stable during use?",
            "content": "<p>Absolutely. It features a non-slip base that keeps it securely in place and prevents movement that could interrupt the moment.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_Dyi9Rr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does it work for all body types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, the viscoelastic foam adapts to different body shapes while maintaining the 27° angle — ensuring balanced and effective comfort for most couples.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_z9xgjr": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the product discreet in the bedroom?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, completely. It looks like a stylish design or decorative pillow rather than an explicit accessory. Its elegant look makes it easy to blend naturally into your bedroom.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_EF3man": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How long does delivery take?",
            "content": "<p>Delivery typically takes <strong>5 to 8 business days</strong> after shipping. You’ll receive a tracking number to monitor your order anytime.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_HaMbzV": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is the product shipped discreetly?",
            "content": "<p>Yes. The packaging is completely anonymous, with no indication of what’s inside. On your bank statement, the purchase will appear under a neutral category such as <strong>Health/Wellness</strong>, ensuring your privacy.</p>"
          }
        },
        "item_LgM4Ag": {
          "type": "item",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What if it doesn’t work?",
            "content": "<p><strong>Intense™</strong> offers a <strong>30-day money-back guarantee</strong>. Most users notice a difference from the very first night. If that’s not the case for you, returns are simple and hassle-free.</p>"
